// The game's tiled lighting cs 0x897232B5 for up to 4096 lights (particle_counts.hpp, MOST_LIGHTS), made from its
// disassembly (3Dmigoto cmd_Decompiler -d, then -a --copy-reflection with the game's shader; README v77): the opaque
// list's empty marker 0xFFFFFFFF, round 4's registers kept, then a loop over lights 255-4095 after the game's (opaque
// list only). Each 8x8 pixel tile keeps the game's 255 lights at most (its groupshared list, the shading loops' counts
// and next-entry clamps as the game's): only the culling grows with the frame's lights. Tested on WARP against the
// game's (README v109).
